# .cursorrules - Senior Principal Engineer Rules (School of Character - Pojok Hope)
# Methodology: obra/superpowers

# 1. SURGICAL EDITS ONLY
- Never delete, rewrite, or alter working functions, views, or CSS rules outside the immediate task scope.
- Maintain existing comments, docstrings, classes, and IDs unless explicitly instructed.
- Inspect exact line numbers before editing.

# 2. CONCISE & DRY CODE
- Zero duplicate event listeners across files (use idempotent locks, e.g., isSavingSchedule).
- Always restore buttons (disabled=false and default innerHTML) in a finally block.
- Preserve design tokens (--color-primary, --color-secondary-dark, --border-color) and mobile responsive CSS.

# 3. PRE-FLIGHT & POST-FLIGHT VERIFICATION
- Always consult PROJECT_MAP.md to understand view mappings and role permissions before modifying code.
- Run after EVERY edit:
    1. py check_syntax.py js
    2. py check_regression.py
    3. py -m compileall python/ (if backend touched)
- Guarantee 0 errors across all verification scripts before completing work.
